# Origin of the catalog/stats JSON API. No trailing slash.
#
# Local dev options (see docs/catalog-hosting.md):
#   1. This app's own embedded catalog API (default) — just `npm run dev`,
#      no second process needed:
#        NEXT_PUBLIC_CATALOG_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
#   2. The real catalog server straight from the submodule, if you want to
#      check parity against the upstream source instead of this app's copy:
#        cd vendor/cardgame/catalog && npm start   # http://localhost:8080
#   3. Serve test/fixtures/ with `npm run dev:fixtures` (http://localhost:8081)
#      to exercise suppression/empty-state paths neither server has data for.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CATALOG_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
